⚡🇩🇿🇳🇪 Algeria made a military donation containing equipments and 4 helicopters (two MI-24V type helicopters and two MI-171) amid tensions between Algeria and Niger's military junta.

This is most likely a diplomatic gesture between the two nations as Niger and Algeria share a 951 kilometers border, making the stability of Niger against terrorist groups and civil unrest necessary for southern Algeria's stability.

