⚡🇬🇼 Guinea-Bissau, a small country in west africa, almost recognized Somaliland following support from the zionist entity and the UAE, only for their plans to fall apart after Somalia intervened with support from Saudi Arabia, Egypt and Turkey.

So now, Somaliland is still recognized by just the zionist entity.

